    <briefdescription>
<para>Exception class that stores file, line, and custom error message. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="class_line_info_exception" kindref="compound">LineInfoException</ref></computeroutput> class extends <computeroutput>std::exception</computeroutput> and adds information about the source file and line number where the exception occurred. This is useful for debugging and detailed error reporting in the Weaver framework.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Features</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Stores the file name and line number.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Stores a custom message.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatically formats a full description including file, line, and message.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Supports prepending and appending additional messages dynamically.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Example usage</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal">(condition)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>throwLineInfoException(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Unexpected<sp/>condition<sp/>occurred&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
